values
('ask-sierra-bar-resizable-built-2026-10-25', 'milestone', 'cpl', 'The Ask Sierra side bar is resizable beside the page (sierra/sidebar.js, cpl-project-tracker#2427)', 'Built by S469 at Sam''s ask of ~23:20Z 2026-10-24 ("Make the sidebar resizable horizontally"): a separator on the bar''s left edge drags and takes ArrowLeft/ArrowRight (40px), Home and End; the words Narrower and Wider do the same for anyone who cannot drag (WCAG 2.5.7). She keeps 340px, the page 600px; the width is remembered per reader (cpl_sierra_bar_w).', 'The library''s cards fit the room she leaves through a container query on .results. Tests: sierra_sidebar (12); sweep public-library-sierra drags the edge across her frame at 1440px.', 'Readers can drag the Ask Sierra panel wider or narrower.', array['sierra','library','public-library','sidebar']::text[], array['sierra/sidebar.js','library/index.html']::text[], 'S469 build, merged 2026-10-25 03:00Z', array['sam-sierra-sidebar-asks-resize-library-prompt-2026-10-24']::text[], 'SkyLemonadeBerry-S469', '2026-10-25', 'proposed', null),
('sierra-reads-public-library-built-2026-10-25', 'milestone', 'cpl', 'Sierra reads the public CPL Library and the text of the pieces the tracker hosts (cpl-chat LIBRARY BLOCK, deployed 03:13Z 2026-10-25)', 'Built by S469 at Sam''s ask (~23:20Z 2026-10-24) after she answered his ELL IET question without naming ELL IET CPL Starting Points. cpl-chat reads cpl_library_public() (cached 10 min), keeps up to three pieces the question names (a college''s by the resolved college, others by title, for-name or topic words), and adds a hosted page''s text (20,000 chars, middle cut). Smoke mode 7x.', 'Rule: link the piece in the first paragraph, answer from its text, add nothing to it. Drafting surfaces read no library (sierra_memory_isolation lists it). Deploy run 40157254434 on Sam''s ask; the production smoke followed on his yes.', 'Sierra now points people to the library''s pieces and answers from what they say.', array['sierra','library','public-library','cpl-chat','retrieval']::text[], array['chatbox/supabase/functions/cpl-chat/index.ts','chatbox/smoke_test.sh']::text[], 'S469 build; cpl-chat-deploy run 40157254434', array['sam-sierra-sidebar-asks-resize-library-prompt-2026-10-24']::text[], 'SkyLemonadeBerry-S469', '2026-10-25', 'proposed', null),
('sierra-audience-asked-at-first-ask-built-2026-10-25', 'milestone', 'cpl', 'Sierra asks who the visitor is at the first Ask, not on arrival (cpl-project-tracker#2427)', 'Built by S469 at Sam''s ask (~23:20Z 2026-10-24: "gently prompt the user to choose their population once they click Ask? I don''t want to complicate the screen with all the choices initially"). With no pick the audience row is off the screen; the first Ask holds the question and she asks "Who are you asking as? I''ll fit my answer to you."; the pick sends it.', 'A stored pick shows as one folded control, Answering for: <pick>, at every width. The crimson flash is gone. Tests: sierra_redesign (4), sierra_page (g); sweep sierra-who.', 'Sierra asks who you are only after you ask your first question.', array['sierra','public-library','audience']::text[], array['sierra/sierra.js','sierra/sierra.css','sierra/index.html']::text[], 'S469 build, merged 2026-10-25 03:00Z', array['sam-sierra-sidebar-asks-resize-library-prompt-2026-10-24']::text[], 'SkyLemonadeBerry-S469', '2026-10-25', 'proposed', null),
('public-pieces-pages-copies-built-2026-10-25', 'milestone', 'cpl', 'ELL IET and DSP Credit Starting Points live on GitHub Pages; their Library records link there (scripts/library_page.py)', 'Built by S469 under Sam''s pick ("GitHub Pages now", ~02:00Z 2026-10-25). scripts/library_page.py copies a public piece made as a Claude artifact to library/<slug>/ (its head lines in <head>, a Light-first theme line). The two records moved at 03:10Z through kb/receipts/cpl_library_pages_urls_2026-10-25_s469.sql (supabase-migrate run 40156994192).', 'The claude.ai pages stay the editable originals and stay in each record''s versions; after an edit there, rerun the script. The vault copies matched the published artifacts byte for byte. Tests: library_pages.', 'Public library links now read cpl-initiative.github.io.', array['library','public-library','public-surfaces']::text[], array['scripts/library_page.py','library/','cpl_library']::text[], 'S469 build; receipt applied 2026-10-25 03:10Z', array['sam-public-pieces-on-github-pages-2026-10-25']::text[], 'SkyLemonadeBerry-S469', '2026-10-25', 'proposed', null),
('public-pages-open-light-built-2026-10-25', 'milestone', 'cpl', 'Sierra, the Fact Sheet, the veteran map, CPL Opportunity and the Library''s pages open Light unless the reader picks Dark (cpl-project-tracker#2428)', 'Built by S469 under Sam''s Open Asks Sheet 126 card 2 (light). Each head script sets data-theme to the stored cpl_theme when dark and to light otherwise (system, junk, nothing). The device-following dark copies went from Sierra, the Fact Sheet and CPL Opportunity. The map inside COBI''s iframe (?embed=1) still follows COBI; the side bar names its host''s theme or the device''s.', 'Merged 2026-10-25 03:31Z. The cobi-dark-mode lane records it.', 'The public pages open in Light unless you choose Dark.', array['dark-mode','public-library','sierra','fact-sheet','sam-ruling']::text[], array['sierra/index.html','fact-sheet/index.html','cpl-opportunity/index.html','veteran-sprint-map/build_selfcontained.py']::text[], 'S469 build, #2428', array['sam-sheet-126-rulings-2026-10-24']::text[], 'SkyLemonadeBerry-S469', '2026-10-25', 'proposed', null),
('pitfall-page-text-cap-loses-next-steps-2026-10-25', 'pitfall', 'cpl', 'A text cap that keeps a page''s start drops what most pages put last: the next steps', 'S469, 2026-10-25: the ELL IET page reads 17,157 characters and its Practical next steps are its last section, the part Sam''s one-step question needed. A 14,000-character cap cut from the end lost exactly that. cpl-chat''s libraryCut keeps the opening 60% and the closing 40% of the budget and drops the middle, where a piece''s tables of evidence sit.', 'Guard: tests/sierra_library.test.js (5) asserts the ELL IET text carries Practical next steps whole, and a longer page keeps its start and its end.', 'When trimming a long page for Sierra, keep its beginning and its ending.', array['sierra','library','retrieval','pitfall']::text[], array['chatbox/supabase/functions/cpl-chat/index.ts']::text[], 'S469 measurement', array['sierra-reads-public-library-built-2026-10-25']::text[], 'SkyLemonadeBerry-S469', '2026-10-25', 'proposed', null)
on conflict (slug) do nothing;
