values ('fact-sheet-funding-sierra-bar-built-2026-10-25', 'milestone', 'cpl', 'The Fact Sheet and the funding model page open Sierra in the side bar; the Fact Sheet''s drawer is retired (cpl-project-tracker#2430)', 'Built by S469 under Sam''s Open Asks Sheet 126 card 1 (public, 23:08Z 2026-10-24). Each page opens her from its own Ask Sierra word, so no chip shows; Close hands focus back to the word. Each names her starters (CPL_SIERRA_SUGGESTED) and surface (CPL_SIERRA_SURFACE, fact-sheet); sierra.js reads both from the same-origin parent.', 'Never from the address: fact-sheet is the one surface a host may claim. fact-sheet/factsheet_sierra.js and its test are gone; tests/check_floor.json lowered sierra_markdown to 34 in the same PR. COBI stays as it is. Sweep: fact-sheet-sierra, -dark, funding-model-sierra.', 'The Fact Sheet and the funding page now open the same Sierra as the library, beside the page.', array['sierra','fact-sheet','funding-model','sidebar','sam-ruling']::text[], array['sierra/sidebar.js','sierra/sierra.js','fact-sheet/index.html','funding-model/index.html']::text[], 'S469 build, #2430', array['sam-sheet-126-rulings-2026-10-24']::text[], 'SkyLemonadeBerry-S469', '2026-10-25', 'proposed', null)
